msgstr "立即补发欠款"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-mercenary-contract.option.pay-what-is-owed.detail"
msgstr "动用有限国库，按姓名补齐现有欠款。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-mercenary-contract.option.pay-what-is-owed.consequence"
msgstr "国库 -2，塔莎关系 +2。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-mercenary-contract.option.create-pension-ledger.label"
msgstr "建立抚恤账册"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-mercenary-contract.option.create-pension-ledger.detail"
msgstr "先确立不可删除的长期债权，再分期支付。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-mercenary-contract.option.create-pension-ledger.consequence"
msgstr "制度能力 +1，塔莎关系 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.prompt"
msgstr "用什么方式解除伊芙拉的锁链？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.context"
msgstr "两种方式都不控制幼龙，只决定战斗中的工具与路径。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.mirelle-ritual.label"
msgstr "断誓仪式"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.mirelle-ritual.detail"
msgstr "米蕾尔削弱节点，让每处锁链更容易摧毁。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.mirelle-ritual.consequence"
msgstr "米蕾尔关系 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.break-chain-nodes.label"
msgstr "工兵拆解"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.break-chain-nodes.detail"
msgstr "依靠塔莎和工兵逐处爆破，保留节点结构证据。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.break-chain-nodes.consequence"
msgstr "塔莎关系 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.prompt"
msgstr "怎样对待仍站在旧旗之下的士兵？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.context"
msgstr "他们执行追捕命令，但其中许多人真心相信赦免能让同伴回家。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.option.offer-exit-right.label"
msgstr "允许自行离队"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.option.offer-exit-right.detail"
msgstr "公开承诺投降或脱离追兵者不会被追责。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.option.offer-exit-right.consequence"
msgstr "制度能力 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.option.demand-surrender.label"
msgstr "必须放下武器"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.option.demand-surrender.detail"
msgstr "只有正式投降才能获得保护。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.option.demand-surrender.consequence"
msgstr "权威倾向 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bell-tower-control.prompt"
msgstr "沉钟塔由谁控制？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bell-tower-control.context"
msgstr "共同控制效率低，独占碎片则会重演双方互不信任的竞赛。"

