msgstr "公开责任记录"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-forge-record.option.publish-the-record.detail"
msgstr "隐藏可复现细节，但公开参与者、用途和代价。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-forge-record.option.publish-the-record.consequence"
msgstr "制度能力 +1，山炉关系 -1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-forge-record.option.seal-dangerous-pages.label"
msgstr "暂时封存图纸"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-forge-record.option.seal-dangerous-pages.detail"
msgstr "由多方保管完整记录，暂不向公众展示。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-forge-record.option.seal-dangerous-pages.consequence"
msgstr "山炉关系 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-silverwood-price.prompt"
msgstr "怎样结束银林的代价转移？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-silverwood-price.context"
msgstr "立即停止会伤害母根，逐步退出仍会让林外城市继续承担一段时间。"

