msgstr "立即停止转移"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-silverwood-price.option.end-cost-transfer.detail"
msgstr "让森林从本场战斗开始承担全部真实损耗。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-silverwood-price.option.end-cost-transfer.consequence"
msgstr "银林关系 -1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-silverwood-price.option.phase-out-gradually.label"
msgstr "限期逐步退出"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-silverwood-price.option.phase-out-gradually.detail"
msgstr "设定公开期限和林外城市席位，降低断裂冲击。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-silverwood-price.option.phase-out-gradually.consequence"
msgstr "银林关系 +1，制度能力 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.prompt"
msgstr "灰旗如何称呼“无旗者”？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.context"
msgstr "它由许多亡者记忆组成，却已经做出不属于任何单个亡者的新选择。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.option.recognize-a-new-person.label"
msgstr "承认新人格"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.option.recognize-a-new-person.detail"
msgstr "正式承认它拥有姓名、拒绝与离开的权利。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.option.recognize-a-new-person.consequence"
msgstr "归名者关系 +2。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.option.protect-until-heard.label"
msgstr "先保护其表达"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.option.protect-until-heard.detail"
msgstr "不急于替它定义人格，在外部威胁中保护它继续回答。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-unflagged-personhood.option.protect-until-heard.consequence"
msgstr "归名者关系 +1，克制 +1。"

